<title>UK: Pillar buys 40 acre site.</title>
<headline>Pillar buys 40 acre site.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pillar Property Investments Plc said on Monday it is buying 40 acres of undeveloped land at a business park near Luton, southern England.</p>
<p>The property investment and development group said in a statement that it plans to develop 630,000 square feet of business park buildings.</p>
<p>It gave no other details.</p>
<p>London Newsroom + 44 171 542 4019</p>
